Functional Requirements
1. Seller Features:
                     Account Management:
Registration/Login: Sellers can register/login via email, phone, or social login.
Profile: Sellers can create and manage their profiles. Verification system for trust & authenticity.
Live Streaming:
Go Live: Sellers can start live streaming auctions.
Real-time Video Streaming: Low-latency streaming to ensure seamless live broadcasts.
Viewer Engagement: Real-time viewer count and engagement indicators (likes, reactions).
Stream Scheduling: Sellers can schedule live streams in advance.
Auction Management:
Start/Stop Auctions: Sellers can start and stop auctions during the live stream.
Real-time Bidding System: Real-time bidding with automatic bid increments.
Countdown Timer: A timer counting down for each auction item to keep bidders engaged.
"Buy Now" Option: Optional alongside bidding, allowing users to immediately purchase items at a set price.
Product Management:
Product Listing: Sellers can add/edit/delete products to be auctioned.
Media Upload: Sellers can upload images/videos of their auction items.
Pricing: Sellers can set a starting bid, reserve price, and buy-now price.
Inventory Management: Track available items for auction, including stock and status.
Real-Time Interaction:
Live Chat: Enable live chat during streams for real-time interaction with buyers.
Emojis and Reactions: Buyers can react with emojis during the auction.
Pin Featured Items: Sellers can highlight certain items in the live stream.
Host Announcements: Sellers can make announcements and highlight key items during the auction.
2. Buyer Features:
Account Management:
Registration/Login: Buyers can register/login via email, phone, or social login.
Profile: Buyers have profiles to track their activities, bids, and purchases.
Auction Participation:
Bidding: Place real-time bids during live auctions.
"Buy Now" Option: Buyers can purchase items immediately, bypassing the auction.
Live Stream Alerts: Buyers are notified when a seller goes live.
Notifications:
Bid Alerts: Notify users if they are outbid.
Auction Updates: Notify users about the status of live auctions and winning bid confirmation.
Order & Payment Alerts: Notify buyers of successful payments and shipping updates.
3. Admin Features:
User & Seller Management:
Account Management: Admin can manage both seller and buyer accounts, approve, block, or remove them.
Verification: Admin can monitor and verify seller profiles and uploaded content for authenticity.
Auction Monitoring:
Live Auction Tracking: Admin can monitor ongoing live auctions to ensure smooth operation.
Dispute Handling: Admin has the authority to intervene in case of disputes during auctions.
Content Moderation:
Content Review: Admin can review live stream content to prevent inappropriate or fraudulent activity (fake bids, spam).
Security: Admin can block/report users engaging in suspicious activities or policy violations.
Analytics & Reporting:
Dashboard: Admin can access a detailed analytics dashboard to track auction performance, user engagement, and platform activity.
Financial Management: Admin can oversee and manage commissions, fees, and payouts.
4. Payment & Order Management:
Payment Integration:
Multiple Payment Methods: Integration of multiple payment methods (credit cards, digital wallets, etc.).
Payment Triggers: Automated payment trigger for winning bidders after auction completion.
Payment History: Both sellers and buyers can access their payment history for transparency.
Order & Shipping Management:
Order Tracking: Allow users to track the status of their orders post-purchase.
Shipping Address Management: Buyers can add and edit shipping addresses for order fulfillment.
Seller Shipping Controls: Sellers can manage shipping options and update delivery statuses.
Delivery Status Updates: Automated delivery status updates for buyers.
5. Ratings & Reviews:
Buyer-Seller Reviews:
Rating System: Buyers can leave reviews and ratings for sellers post-auction.
Trust & Credibility: Sellers' ratings and reviews will be visible to build trust within the platform.
6. Security & Moderation:
Fraud Prevention:
Fraud Detection: The system will flag suspicious activity such as fake bids or spam.
User Reporting: Buyers and sellers can report/block users who engage in fraudulent behavior.
Content Moderation: Admins can moderate content during live streams to ensure compliance with platform rules.
7. Notifications System:
Live Stream Alerts: Notify users when a seller goes live.
Bidding Alerts: Notify users when they are outbid or when they win.
Order & Payment Notifications: Inform buyers and sellers of order completion, payment success, and shipping updates.
8. Seller Spin Wheel Feature (Optional):
Spin Wheel Integration: Sellers can create a spin wheel for additional interactive bidding. The highest bidder will trigger a virtual spin to win an item, such as rare cards or exclusive memorabilia.
